  "data": {
    "summary": "On a charge declaration by the bearer’s unit, you can invoke Harpooned. An enemy MONSTER/VEHICLE must be within 12\" of the charger and have taken a hit from this weapon earlier in the turn. Give the charger +2 on its charge rolls for the remainder of the phase. It must finish its move engaged with that enemy.",
